{"id":"en_this-love-was-not-programmed","title":"This Love Was Not Programmed","titleEn":"This Love Was Not Programmed","description":"Genius engineer Laura Taylor takes in a defective robot and saves it from its fate. What begins as unwavering devotion gradually transforms into suspicious fixation, and the two are drawn into a love that is not permitted. As questions of destiny and human fragility surround them, Laura has no idea that the robot holds a profound secret about love, one that remains locked away from her. The story traces how a bond of loyalty can shift into obsession and how much Laura does not yet understand about the machine she rescued. The series and its episodes can be followed on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/this-love-was-not-programmed/en_US/cf4a25562a758e10/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/this-love-was-not-programmed/en_US/cf4a25562a758e10/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Sacrificing for Love","Second Chance","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d9ju4/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_this-love-was-not-programmed_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d9ju4/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_this-love-was-not-programmed_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d9ju4/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_this-love-was-not-programmed_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d9ju4/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_this-love-was-not-programmed_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id"